      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and thorough veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently commend the warmth, attentiveness, and medical expertise demonstrated by Dr. Seymour, Dr. Brunetti, and Dr. Lauderdale. Reviewers note that both veterinarians and technicians listen carefully to owner concerns and provide supportive guidance during stressful visits. Clients appreciate the friendly front desk staff and report feeling welcomed and well cared for throughout each consultation."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 32,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and patient pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise the gentle handling shown to both dogs and cats during wellness checkups and medical procedures. Reviewers with elderly pets or anxious animals emphasize that doctors and assistants handle their companions with kindness and soothing care. Owners feel confident that their pets are in safe hands, noting that appointments are conducted with genuine compassion."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean and quiet clinic environment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on the welcoming, tidy, and calm atmosphere of the animal hospital. Reviewers appreciate that the waiting room and examination areas are kept impeccably clean and comfortable for both pets and their owners. The relaxed and organized setting helps lower anxiety for visiting dogs and cats while families wait for their scheduled consultations."
      }
    }
  ],
